// title: Identify assets from MDEASM in Exposure Management · Microsoft Defender XDR
// date: 2026-10-21
// product: Defender XDR
// tables: ExposureGraphNodes
// purpose: The following query will help identify which assets are available from Microsoft Defender External Attack Surface Management in the Advanced Hunting tables from Exposure Management.
// source: https://github.com/cyb3rmik3/KQL-threat-hunting-queries/blob/6327d5a78455432e0dbd32cb5c8c281e6f7fda05/XSPM/identify-assets-from-mdeasm-in-exposure-management.md
// kind: repo
// author: Michalis Michalos
// license: MIT (as stated by the repository)
// archived by tools/kql_archive.py (CLAUDE.md 5l, 5eu)
ExposureGraphNodes
| extend deepLinkInfo = parse_json(NodeProperties)["rawData"]["deepLink"]
| where deepLinkInfo startswith "https://portal.azure.com/#view/Microsoft_Azure_EASM/"
